    "title": "David & Victoria Beckham Show Birthday Love to Estranged Son Brooklyn Beckham After Fiery Feud - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nadia Mumuni ,\n3 hours ago\nDespite ongoing tension, David Beckham and Victoria Beckham made sure their eldest son felt the love on his 27th birthday.\nBoth took to social media to honor Brooklyn Beckham , sharing sentimental throwback snaps from his childhood. David posted a sweet poolside memory, affectionately calling him by his nickname 'Bust' and signing off with love.\nVictoria followed suit, uploading nostalgic photos of Brooklyn as a toddler and gushing over her firstborn.\nThe public display comes amid continued headlines about a rift within the famous family, tensions that intensified following Brooklyn's 2022 wedding to Nicola Peltz .\nMurmurs of friction have swirled ever since, with Brooklyn previously airing grievances online and David later offering a measured response during an appearance, saying:\n\"Children are allowed to make mistakes...you have to sometimes let them make those mistakes as well.\"\nStill, at least publicly, it's all love on his big day.\nYour thoughts? 3",
    "summary": "Both took to social media to honor Brooklyn Beckham , sharing sentimental throwback snaps from his childhood. David posted a sweet poolside memory, affectionately calling him by his nickname 'Bust' and signing off with love. Victoria followed suit, uploading nostalgic photos of Brooklyn as a toddler and gushing over her firstborn. The public display comes amid continued headlines about a rift within the famous family, tensions that intensified following Brooklyn's 2022 wedding to Nicola Peltz .",
